{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by Exit 8, The Underpass is an anomaly hunting game in which you must remember your surroundings and spot any differences in order to escape the loop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At release the game has 30+ anomalies, with an average gameplay length of 30-60 minutes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mouse &amp; Keyboard and Controller support.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Autosave system so you never lose progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anomalies do not repeat until all have been discovered, making completionist runs easier.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable graphics settings, allowing the game to run on a wide variety of PCs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accessibility settings like toggle sprint, disabling effects such as motion blur, camera sway, etc.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No flashing lights, large moving patterns or other photosensitive epilepsy triggers*.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*If you discover a potential epilepsy trigger or other accessibility issue that I have missed, please let me know via the Steam forums!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Welcome to Zone 10","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4111120/6b2cc6b1231e4204d34efc497e666f42b0eec92c.jpg"},{"name":"Detective","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4111120/f49ea64fcbbadb42c85ef839b89433adbf18c294.jpg"},{"name":"Change Blindness","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4111120/ea312b773f88afa91812d7bdfddbc4b55b2d1fc2.jpg"},{"name":"Paranoia","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4111120/c1b2a6bf71a82707f0c90bfb6c89d16971629c21.jpg"},{"name":"Welcome to [REDACTED]","path":"ht